			],
			"derivation": "The earlier import flagged John Smith (with Jon Smith) and Casey Brooks (with Casey Morgan) for review; Maria Delgado with Maria Santos was marked \"Not a duplicate\", so it is not listed. A pair is a possible duplicate, never proof."
		}
